@startuml exp4_class
title Experiment 4 - C4 code level: classes and functions
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class "main()" as Main <<function>> {
  +main(argc, argv) : int
  builds 5 counters and 2 contender lists
  prints uncontended and contended tables
}

class Contender <<struct>> {
  +name : string
  +run_once : function returning RaceResult
}

class "shared_contender~C~()" as SharedC <<function>> {
  +shared_contender(counter, cpus, iterations) : Contender
  wraps race() in a std function, one call per race
}

class "measure_interleaved()" as Interleaved <<function>> {
  +measure_interleaved(contenders) : vector of Measurement
  warmup, then rotated trials
}

class Measurement <<struct>> {
  +slowest : TrialStats
  +fastest : TrialStats
  +aggregate_mops : TrialStats
  +cas_failures_per_increment : double
  +kernel_fraction : double
  +ok() : bool
}

class PlainCounter <<reference>> {
  +increment() : uint64
  -v_ : volatile uint64
}

class FetchAddCounter <<counter>> {
  +increment() : uint64
  -v_ : atomic uint64
}

class CasCounter <<counter>> {
  +increment() : uint64  returns failed attempts
  -v_ : atomic uint64
}

class SpinlockCounter <<counter>> {
  +increment() : uint64
  -locked_ : atomic bool
  -v_ : uint64
}

class MutexCounter <<counter>> {
  +increment() : uint64
  -m_ : std mutex
  -v_ : uint64
}

Main ..> PlainCounter : creates
Main ..> FetchAddCounter : creates
Main ..> CasCounter : creates
Main ..> SpinlockCounter : creates
Main ..> MutexCounter : creates
Main ..> SharedC : calls for each contender
Main ..> Interleaved : calls twice, solo and duo
SharedC ..> Contender : returns
Interleaved ..> Contender : races each one
Interleaved ..> Measurement : returns

note bottom of PlainCounter
  Only correct with one thread. Shown as the no-synchronization reference.
end note
@enduml
